[
  {
    "id": "anno-tsurumai_upper_p153_left-00",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "巳七月四百十五石三斗七升六合一勺七才ヲ受取リ全ク殘リ不足高百石"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "巳年七月に四百十五石三斗七升六合一勺七才をことごとく受け取り、残る不足高は百石…"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "In the seventh month of the snake year (1869) the domain received 415.37617 koku in full; the shortfall still outstanding is one hundred koku... (the sentence runs on into the next column to the left). With that column it accounts for the 515.53246 koku conversion deficit printed on the facing recto."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "節替高註記（一）"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
      "source": "images/upper_p153_left.jpg",
      "selector": {
        "type": "FragmentSelector",
        "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/",
        "value": "xywh=pixel:2556,1151,120,2600"
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "anno-tsurumai_upper_p153_left-01",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "壹斗五升六合二勺九才ナリ卽チ本文ノ高ナリ"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "…一斗五升六合二勺九才なり。すなわち本文の高なり。"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "...and 0.15629 koku; that is, 100.15629 koku, which is the figure given in the main text. (415.37617 + 100.15629 = 515.53246 koku, the deficit printed opposite.)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "節替高註記二"
      }
    ],
