  {
    "id": "anno-tsurumai_upper_p153_left-02",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "（午年調米二萬三千四百六十八石八斗四升六合三勺八才　鹽ヲ記セス金以下雜稅等ハ巳年ニ同シ）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（午年の調米は二万三千四百六十八石八斗四升六合三勺八才。塩を記さず、金以下の雑税等は巳年に同じ。）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "(For the horse year (1870) the assessed rice was 23,468.84638 koku. Salt is not recorded, and from the gold entry onward, the miscellaneous taxes and the rest, the figures are the same as for the snake year.) Printed as a two-line inset note."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "午年調米割註"
      }
